    "gearCatalogWeaponSmgDescription": "Rattler is a black-market family, not one factory pattern. Pirate shops and Pather cells turn civilian flechette mechanisms into brutal close-range boarding carbines.",
    "gearCatalogWeaponSmgDisplayName": "Shredder Carbine",
