    "openingSecondhandWingsThoseHermesWrecksGotUsStartedWe": "Those Hermes wrecks got us started. We patched one for the first contracts; opening the sealed bay gives us the other. But four seats and a courier's engine mean too many trips under fire. Mara has found two surplus Aeroshuttles. Rough paint, sound frames. We pay the yard to make them ours.",
