    "openingSecondhandWingsThoseAreOursCaptainProperLandingCraft": "Those are ours, Captain. Proper landing craft, paid for by our work. Two Aeroshuttles, six seats each. A twelve-person squad can land together when both fly; larger forces still need repeat trips. The bay adapters belong to Second Wind. Select a boat, then PLATING or DRIVE to compare upgrades. Plating improves survival; drives shorten the approach. Nothing else needs buying now. The next briefing uses these actual boats.",
