    "openingCerberusCompanyStartYourCompanyIsReadyCommanderTheFirst": "We're a company, Commander. Mara Venn's first contract is waiting in Headquarters. Whatever stores we didn't use stay in the depot for when we're back.",
    "openingCerberusCompanyStartOurShipIsHomeNowStayDocked": "She's ours now, Commander, properly. Stay docked while we use the prepaid stores: patch the first wrecked Hermes on the Boat Deck, settle Sabine's first specialty in Barracks, then muster her squad in the Armory and put it under her. I'll take you through each order.",
    "openingCerberusCompanyStartAnAccessiblePlanetarySpaceport": "an accessible planetary spaceport",
    "openingCerberusCompanyStartFirstWeNeedMercenaryCompanyConversionOur": "First, the conversion: barracks and a workshop, built into her for good. Five thousand credits. {0}Choose Return, dock at {1} and open Marine operations from the planet menu; I''ll have the yard order waiting. It isn''t in the standard Refit picker, and Additional Berthing won''t do it. Nothing gets designated until the yard has done its work. Our prepaid stores will wait in the planetary depot.",
