    "openingCerberusCompanyStartTheConversionIsInstalledStayDockedAt": "The conversion is in. Stay docked at {0}, open Marine operations and name our Cerberus the company''s command ship. While we''re docked here, the preparation bills draw on our depot stock. Then we repair the first Hermes, settle Sabine''s appointment and put her section on the roll.",
