    "refitTransferCopy": "Wayline can transfer one equipment package as thanks for holding their checkpoint. Compare both paths, then choose one free technology transfer. Its specs are yours permanently; the Machine Shop fits them for free. The other path can be learned later through markets or mission rewards.",
