		"defenceReportColourTOXIC": "The check-ins came through rebreathers, every word half static.|Survivors say the haze was thick enough to hide a lander until it was down.|The air scrubbers on the post ran hot the whole night.",
		"defenceReportColourAIRLESS": "There was no sound out there, only the shudder of the deck through the boots.|Every report came in sealed-suit flat, all breath and no echo.|Landing flares hung in the black longer than they had any right to.",
